Today I solved leetcode question 2778: Sum of squares of special elements.

Description: We are given an array which is 1-indexed.
              And n is the size of array.
              Then we must return the sum of squares of elements whose index number completely divides n.
              eg- array=[1,2,3,4]
                  n=4 
                  ans=21 

Solution: First we create answer variable.
          Then we start our for loop from 0 till array size minus 1.
          Now we will check whether array size divided by i+1 is zero or not.
          If yes then we will add square of number at i to answer.
